      situation_en: "LuxParis is a French luxury fashion house (€1.2Bn revenue, 80 global boutiques, 3 categories: leather goods, women's RTW, jewelry). Present in Europe, USA, and Dubai, but not in Asia. Japan is the 3rd largest luxury market worldwide (€35Bn). The CEO wants to know whether to enter Japan and how.",
