      structure_hint_en: "Classic market entry framework: (1) Market attractiveness (size, growth, trends, segments) (2) Competitive analysis (who is already there?) (3) LuxParis's ability to win (product/customer fit, differentiating advantages) (4) Entry modes (JV, franchise, own network, selective distribution) (5) Financials and risks",
